{"id":"b61898f862c734c8","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-derivability-conditions.md","title":"Internal provability conditions","display":"df-derivability-conditions — Internal provability conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-derivability-conditions","aliases":["72-df-derivability-conditions"],"display":"df-derivability-conditions — Internal provability conditions","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]"],"source_kind":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency","verification_status":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-derivability-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-derivability-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivability-conditions — Internal provability conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formal-completion-of-existing-dependency"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formal-interface-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件使用算术化接口的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 检查推导的每一行均为数公式。</li>\n<li>取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\">\\(\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\kappa\">\\(e_\\kappa\\)</span>、数码与捕获避免代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\\)</span> 有效可公理化且包含 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA}\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(A,B,G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\">\\(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\)</span> 是对象算术句的构造，不是模态语言的构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{D1},\\operatorname{D2},\\operatorname{D3},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\">\\(\\operatorname{D1},\\operatorname{D2},\\operatorname{D3},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}\\)</span> 是元语言谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span> 取编码接口固定的数变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline{e_\\kappa(A)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline{e_\\kappa(A)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)} A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E_{\\rm PR})\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)}[G\\leftrightarrow B[\\overline{e_\\kappa(G)}/x_0]])\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)} A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E_{\\rm PR})\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)}[G\\leftrightarrow B[\\overline{e_\\kappa(G)}/x_0]])\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原有PRA第二不完备性结论实际使用的可证性条件接口。D1是对实际定理的数码可验证性；D2、D3是理论内的合成与正内省。它们不同于“在标准自然数上与证明关系同扩张”。所有引号及嵌套引号均使用同一编码元组。FP独立列明对角引理的准确输入输出，不以“标准编码”代替这些条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的 $\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$、$\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}$、$e_\\kappa$、数码与捕获避免代入。$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}$ 有效可公理化且包含 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]] 的 $\\mathsf{PRA}$；$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]] 的 $\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$、$\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}$、$e_\\kappa$、数码与捕获避免代入。$T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}$ 有效可公理化且包含 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]] 的 $\\mathsf{PRA}$；$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"e_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathsf S_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{D1},\\operatorname{D2},\\operatorname{D3},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A:=\\operatorname{Prov}_{T,\\kappa}(\\overline{e_\\kappa(A)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)} A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}B)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\quad T\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\bigl[\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A\\to\\Box_{T,\\kappa}(\\Box_{T,\\kappa}A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HBL}(T,\\kappa)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{D1}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D2}(T,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{D3}(T,\\kappa),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FP}(T,\\kappa)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_1(E_{\\rm PR})\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq\\{x_0\\}\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ (T\\vdash_2^{(1)}[G\\leftrightarrow B[\\overline{e_\\kappa(G)}/x_0]])\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2735,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第2章主题：[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-derivability-conditions]]"},{"id":"0869da29c285cc44","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,\\kappa,\\mathsf{Sent},\\Box_{T,\\kappa},\\operatorname{HBL},\\operatorname{FP}$ 取 [[72-df-derivability-conditions]]，包括 $\\mathsf{PRA}\\subseteq T$ 与 $\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(T)$。$\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}$、$\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(T)$ 取该接口引用的算术化定义。"},{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})$、$\\lambda\\in\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PRA})$、$\\operatorname{Con}_\\lambda,\\operatorname{Con}_{\\rm meta}^{(1)}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]；$q\\in\\mathsf P_1$、$\\operatorname{Trans}$ 取 [[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]。$\\operatorname{HBL}$ 取 [[72-df-derivability-conditions]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-derivability-conditions|72-df-derivability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["4c14656043bc77c1","1c3ecb3059f70f57"]}